Well, the screen name is Work Work Eliza, but we understand that it's Rose, but Work Work Eliza Rose, if you could just expand a little, we are curious, if you were actually named after the person, or you just happen to have the same name, okay.
好吧，网名是“工作工作伊莉莎”，但我们知道那是罗斯，不过“工作工作伊莉莎·罗斯”，如果你能稍微展开说说，我们很好奇，你究竟是不是按那个人的名字取名的，还是纯粹刚好同名，好吧。

