I'm curious, Josh, I don't totally, do you remember specific moments where you really lost your shit or you did something insane happen?
我很想知道，乔什，我不太确定，你还记得有哪些特定时刻，你真的是笑到崩溃或者发生了什么疯狂的事情吗？

