It is, yeah, it's very easy to get.
确实在，对，很容易就能找到。

00:22:57.940 --> 00:23:01.339
It's on YouTube, for sure, and it was on those DVDs, And yeah, look it up.
YouTube上绝对有，而且那些DVD里也有，是的，去查查看吧。

00:23:01.339 --> 00:23:03.940
That was a really interesting scene in the finale that we just.
大结局里那段真的很有意思，我们只是……

